Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:37:30 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(gateway): let an agent run request and await its own exec
 approvals

In-process dispatch keeps the scope ceiling of the System client that
started the run, which holds operator.write without operator.approvals,
so exec.approval.request and exec.approval.waitDecision from an agent run
were refused. A live agent run's own client now holds requester authority
for those two methods, and a waitDecision without the approvals scope sees
only approvals its connection registered.

